<div data-cgap-sector="Food &amp; Beverage Processing" data-cgap-term="food processing"></div><p class="lead">Food plants combine heavy machinery, steam, caustic cleaning chemicals and daily washdown. The signs that matter are the ones posted right at the kettle, the grinder, the CIP panel and the retort, telling a sanitation worker or new operator exactly what to do there.</p><p>This collection covers steam jacketed kettles, CIP systems, meat grinders, fryers, retorts, ribbon and planetary mixers, bottle fillers, tote dumpers and bakery equipment. Aluminum stands up to washdown far better than plastic or vinyl.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area"><h3>Steam jacketed kettle</h3><p>53 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the front of the kettle shell below the rim at hand height.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-steam-kettle-jacket-sign-cgap-c01021-812">Steam Kettle Jacket</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-steam-kettle-rim-sign-cgap-c01156-812">Steam Kettle Rim</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-kettle-draw-off-valve-sign-cgap-c01291-812">Kettle Draw-Off Valve</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-kettle-tilt-handwheel-sign-cgap-c01426-812">Kettle Tilt Handwheel</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Bakery equipment</h3><p>52 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the deck oven front below the door handle.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-deck-oven-door-sign-cgap-c17152-812">Deck Oven Door</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-deck-oven-loading-area-sign-cgap-c17285-812">Deck Oven Loading Area</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-oven-peel-rack-sign-cgap-c17418-812">Oven Peel Rack</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-rack-oven-door-sign-cgap-c17551-812">Rack Oven Door</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>CIP system</h3><p>46 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the heat exchanger frame at hand height on the operator side.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-cip-heat-exchanger-sign-cgap-c10111-812">CIP Heat Exchanger</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-cip-return-pump-sign-cgap-c10246-812">CIP Return Pump</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-cip-supply-tank-sign-cgap-c10381-812">CIP Supply Tank</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-cip-tank-platform-grating-sign-cgap-c10516-812">CIP Tank Platform Grating</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Meat grinder</h3><p>43 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the grinder room door at eye level facing people entering (grinder room floor).</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-grinder-room-floor-sign-cgap-c01020-812">Grinder Room Floor</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-grinder-allergen-changeover-sign-cgap-n02165-812">Grinder Allergen Changeover</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-meat-grinder-feed-throat-sign-cgap-w00023-812">Meat Grinder Feed Throat</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-meat-grinder-hopper-sign-cgap-i01020-812">Meat Grinder Hopper</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Fryer</h3><p>36 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the fryer side panel (fryer exterior).</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-fryer-exterior-sign-cgap-c18541-812">Fryer Exterior</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-fryer-hood-edge-sign-cgap-c18671-812">Fryer Hood Edge</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-fryer-filter-pump-sign-cgap-c18799-812">Fryer Filter Pump</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-fryer-filter-cart-sign-cgap-c19125-812">Fryer Filter Cart</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Retort</h3><p>19 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the wall or frame beside the retort door.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-retort-door-exterior-sign-cgap-c10109-812">Retort Door Exterior</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-retort-process-deviation-sign-cgap-n12129-812">Retort Process Deviation</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-retort-door-latch-sign-cgap-w00027-812">Retort Door Latch</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-retort-door-lugs-sign-cgap-i11254-812">Retort Door Lugs</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Ribbon blender</h3><p>17 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Blender lid.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-ribbon-blender-sign-8x12-aluminum">Ribbon Blender</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-ribbon-blender-discharge-gate-sign-cgap-c01019-812">Ribbon Blender Discharge Gate</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-ribbon-blender-discharge-valve-sign-cgap-n01019-812">Ribbon Blender Discharge Valve</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-ribbon-blender-lid-sign-cgap-i01019-812">Ribbon Blender Lid</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Bottle filler</h3><p>14 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the filler guard near the cup storage (filler cip cups).</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-filler-cip-cups-sign-cgap-c13140-812">Filler CIP Cups</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-filler-product-hose-sign-cgap-c13275-812">Filler Product Hose</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-filler-operator-platform-sign-cgap-c15687-812">Filler Operator Platform</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-filler-catwalk-sign-cgap-c16020-812">Filler Catwalk</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>Do these signs hold up to daily washdown?</summary><p>Yes. They are printed aluminum and handle routine sanitation chemicals and hot water.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have signs for CIP and sanitation lockout?</summary><p>Yes, including CIP panel, chemical supply and equipment lockout points. Search &quot;CIP&quot;.</p></details><details><summary>What about bakery equipment?</summary><p>Mixers, dough sheeters, proofers and ovens are covered. Search the machine name.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Do these signs hold up to daily washdown?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. They are printed aluminum and handle routine sanitation chemicals and hot water."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have signs for CIP and sanitation lockout?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, including CIP panel, chemical supply and equipment lockout points. Search \"CIP\"."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What about bakery equipment?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Mixers, dough sheeters, proofers and ovens are covered. Search the machine name."}}]}</script>